    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bowe Property is delighted to bring to the market No. 2 The Mill Race, MacSwiney Quay, Bandon, Co. Cork. Ideally positioned in this sought-after riverside development, this attractive two-bedroom apartment offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation together with the convenience of being just a short stroll from Bandon town centre. The accommodation comprises two spacious bedrooms with built-in robes, one ensuite, a family bathroom and a generous open-plan kitchen, living and dining area. A particular feature of the apartment is the lovely outlook towards the Bandon River, creating a pleasant and relaxing aspect from the main living space. The property also benefits from electric heating and designated parking in a secure gated car park. The Millrace is ideally located for those wishing to enjoy town centre living, with a wide range of local amenities all within easy walking distance. Whether seeking a comfortable first home, a property suitable for downsizing or a sound investment, No. 2 The Millrace offers an appealing combination of location, convenience and riverside living.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by prior appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (L-Shape) - 4.39m x 2.29m x 1.32m\r\nAccess to bedrooms, open plan kitchen/dining/living area, bathroom & airing cupboard. Ceramic tilled floor. Radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living Area - 5.90m x 5.74m\r\nFully fitted kitchen with presses & cupboards. Appliances include integrated electric oven, hob & over head extractor. Free standing washing machine/ dryer, dishwasher & fridge/freezer. Ceramic tilled flooring & splashback. Two windows to the rear of the property with exquisite views onto the Bandon River. Wooden floors in living/dining area. T.V. & telephone points. Intercom telephone. Two radiators. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.23m x 1.20m\r\nFully fitted with w.c. & wash-hand basin. Cornered thermostatically controlled shower unit. Ceramic tilled walls & floor. Window to the front of the property. Extractor fan. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.07m x 3.37m \r\nBuilt in robe. Window to rear with exquisite views over Bandon River. Wooden floor. T.V point. Radiator. Access to ensuite. \r\nEnsuite ( 2.76m x 1.57m)\r\nFully fitted with w.c. & wash-hand basin. Bathtub with overhead thermostatically controlled shower. Window to side with exquisite views over the Bandon River. Ceramic tiled walls & floor. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.38m x 3.38m\r\nBuilt in robe. Window to side with exquisite views over Bandon River. Wall mounted display units. Wooden floor. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures & Services\r\n-Modern electric heating\r\n-Mains water & drainage\r\n-€2200 management fee per annum."
      },
      {
